# vendorja — git attributes for the data directory.
#
# THIS FILE EXISTS TO PROTECT ONE MEASURED PROPERTY: a daily commit of the
# 63 MB data/kosovo-retail.json costs ~12 KB in the repacked pack, because
# every new version is the old version plus an append plus point edits and
# git deltifies that almost perfectly (docs/REFRESH.md §5). Anything that
# rewrites the file's bytes wholesale turns that 12 KB back into a ~6.5 MB
# blob, every day, forever. Two such things are one config flag away:
#
#   -text   A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites line
#           endings on files git thinks are text. For a data file that is
#           not a formatting preference, it is a CONTENT change: the blob
#           hash moves, the delta chain against the previous version breaks,
#           and the working copy no longer matches what CI and Vercel read.
#           `-text` means "never convert, in either direction", so the bytes
#           on disk are the bytes in the object store on every platform.
#
#   -diff   data/kosovo-retail.json is 66,195,438 bytes on ONE line (it is
#           minified — there is not a single newline in it). Marking it
#           -diff stops git, GitHub and every review tool from trying to
#           render a textual diff of a 66 MB line, which is never useful and
#           is how a `git log -p` or a PR page hangs.
#
# WHAT IS DELIBERATELY *NOT* HERE: `-delta`. That attribute disables delta
# compression and is the one setting that would actually cause the bloat
# this file is here to prevent. Never add it.
#
# [measured] 2026-09-18, two bare repos, real catalogue as v1 and v1 + 1,000
# appended rows + 400 changed prices as v2, `git gc` after each:
#
#   without .gitattributes   v1 packed 5,537 KiB   v1+v2 packed 5,584 KiB
#   with    .gitattributes   v1 packed 5,537 KiB   v1+v2 packed 5,584 KiB
#
# Identical. The `diff` and `text` attributes affect diff generation and
# checkout filters, not packing, so this costs nothing.

data/*.json                 -text
data/kosovo-retail.json     -diff
data/kosovo-retail-xapi.json -diff
